# Sample App

The sample app is the living reference for implemented SDK capability (see ADR-0006 and `AGENTS.md`).

- Do not add UI for SDK endpoints that are not yet implemented.
- When adding or changing SDK endpoints, update sample pages and navigation in the same change.
- Follow the probe-page standard in [`docs/contributing/sample-probe-pages.md`](../../docs/contributing/sample-probe-pages.md).
- Reference implementations: `Company.razor` (single GET), `Contacts.razor` (list + per-row mapping), `ContactDetail.razor` (CRUD + seed data).
- Reuse shared probe components:
  - `EndpointProbeHeader` — call under test, API docs link (`DocsUrl`), environment, endpoint path
  - `ModelWireDiagnostics` + `ModelProbeResults` — wire-to-model mapping, filter chips, raw JSON
  - `ApiErrorDiagnostics` — API error payloads
- List pages: inspect mapping per wire array item. CRUD pages: `?id=` deep links, fetch wire JSON after create/update, `MudProgressLinear` while loading.
- Only model wire fields from the official FreeAgent API docs.
- When editing MudBlazor UI, use the `mudblazor` skill in `.agents/skills/mudblazor/`.
